// PutAppForwardWithBody Set where your own notifications from the gateway go
//
// For an app whose gateway has one notification address per merchant
// (`forwards` is true), billing posts each notification that isn't
// about one of its own payments to this URL, as received, with
// `Edgescale-Forwarded: billing` added. Anything but a 2xx is retried
// for about three weeks. An empty URL stops forwarding.
//
// Only a notification whose gateway signature checks out is forwarded,
// and a replay of one only once a day, so the app's signing setting
// comes first: for Qi, its public key. Setting a URL without it is a
