// your own and makes this safe to send again: the same reference
// returns the first checkout, and one reused for another invoice,
// amount or app is a 409. The amount defaults to what is still due,
// and can't be more. Unless the project's payment settings allow
// overlapping checkouts, a pending checkout holds its amount: the
// default amount is what's left, and one that doesn't fit is a 409
